#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:4
msgid "Conditional Workflow Tasks"
msgstr "Conditional Flujo de trabajo Tareas"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:9
msgid ""
"Conditional Workflow Tasks provide branching logic within |morpheus| "
"Workflows. A Conditional Workflow Task evaluates a JavaScript expression "
"and, based on the result, executes one of two Operational Workflows — "
"enabling dynamic, decision-based automation chains."
msgstr ""
"Conditional Flujo de trabajo Tareas provide branching logic within "
"|morpheus| Flujos de trabajo. A Conditional Flujo de trabajo Tarea "
"evaluates a JavaScript expression and, based on the result, executes one "
"of two Operational Flujos de trabajo — enabling dynamic, decision-based "
"automation chains."

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:11
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This task type is found in :menuselection:`Library --> Automation` "
"(Library > Automation > Tasks) with the type **Conditional Workflow**."
msgstr ""
"This tarea type is found in |LibAut| (Library > Automation > Tareas) with"
" the type **Conditional Flujo de trabajo**."

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:14
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "Cómo It Works"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:16
msgid "The Conditional Workflow Task operates on a simple if/else model:"
msgstr "The Conditional Flujo de trabajo Tarea operates on a simple if/else model:"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:18
msgid "A JavaScript expression is evaluated"
msgstr "Un JavaScript expression es evaluated"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:19
msgid "If the expression resolves to ``true``, the **If Workflow** is executed"
msgstr ""
"If the expression resolves to ``true``, the **If Flujo de trabajo** is "
"executed"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:20
msgid "If the expression resolves to ``false``, the **Else Workflow** is executed"
msgstr ""
"If the expression resolves to ``false``, the **Else Flujo de trabajo** is"
" executed"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:21
msgid "The parent Workflow continues after the conditional branch completes"
msgstr ""
"The parent Flujo de trabajo continues after the conditional branch "
"completes"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:23
msgid ""
"Parent Workflow\n"
"├── Task 1\n"
"├── Conditional Workflow Task\n"
"│   ├── [true]  → If Operational Workflow\n"
"│   └── [false] → Else Operational Workflow\n"
"└── Task 3 (continues after conditional)"
msgstr ""
"Parent Flujo de trabajo\n"
"├── Tarea 1\n"
"├── Conditional Flujo de trabajo Tarea\n"
"│   ├── [true]  → If Operational Flujo de trabajo\n"
"│   └── [false] → Else Operational Flujo de trabajo\n"
"└── Tarea 3 (continues after conditional)"

